{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act38side_level_act38side_09_beg",
  "groupId": "act38side",
  "stageId": "act38side_09",
  "title": "狼群與群狼",
  "storyCode": "PV-9",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act38side/level_act38side_09_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "3802b8f67be21e979b2095c434e2b3402bb63f7691d28866a167c6e5470500ac",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我實在是聽不下去了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "別激動，多利。這個樂手也沒胡說，在敘拉古的傳說裡，羊確實就是這樣的形象。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你要是真的氣不過，就從羊花車上跳到他頭上踩幾腳，反正今天晚上發生什麼都沒人會覺得稀奇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我只是曾經喜歡被那些狼追著跑，在敘拉古的那陣子，和他們捉迷藏算是我為數不多的樂趣……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "結果敘拉古人卻以為我“害怕”那些狼？真是人言可畏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這個成語可不是這麼用的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你在說風涼話嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "大帝，你在敘拉古人的認知裡是什麼樣的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "大嘴巴，告訴他黑袍歌唱家的偉大事蹟！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呃……從前有個家族領袖非常討厭音樂，他禁止了音樂在他的城市出現，直到許多年後一位黑袍企鵝歌手到來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "歌手在廣場上自顧自唱歌，市民們對音樂沒有概念，他們只覺得吵鬧，所以想要把歌手抓起來交給家族領袖處罰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但歌手非常靈活，再精壯的青年也抓不住他……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "歌聲不停，越來越多的人加入抓捕的隊伍，漸漸，歌手與市民的搏鬥變成了一場所有人都捲入其中的舞蹈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "歌手就這麼唱了三天三夜，直到怒不可遏的家族領袖親自來抓他。但家族領袖一出門就被狂歡的人潮淹沒，再也沒有人見過他——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "為什麼聽起來像是聰明又正義的大英雄，但大帝明明不如我有智慧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這不是智慧，是態度。是潘格溫伯爵對音樂的態度，自由與抗爭！多利，我送你的簽名專輯你是不是都沒有聽？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "走吧，別擋住後面人的路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "樂手",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（興奮地吹奏）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雜耍藝人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（興奮地表演火舞）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "樂手",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（更賣力地吹奏）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雜耍藝人",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（不服輸地炫技）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路人A",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "阿基萊，我的阿基萊呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路人B",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉，女士，您現在才發現自己和陌生人並肩走了半個小時嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路人A",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊，我認得你的聲音，你是之前特爾尼城的那個法官！對不起，是萊卡家族的人逼迫我做偽證——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路人B",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "（敲了敲面具）那都是過去的事了。女士，您違反了狂歡節的規則。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "路人B",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "看看身邊，大家都戴上了面具，今夜，無所謂身分、貧富、種族，忘卻過往的仇恨……請我喝杯啤酒吧，為新沃爾西尼舉杯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "人群從三位獸主的身邊經過，多利的分身往來穿梭，所有人都看得見牠們，但無人大驚小怪。\n身處狂歡的洪流之中，沒有一朵浪花稱得上異樣。\n十多輛巨型花車前後相連，狼、羊、企鵝、貓、狗……傳說中散落大地各處的野獸們齊聚在同一個城市，引領著人群向前。\n傳統戲劇表演和即興演出擠滿了街道，樂手與雜耍藝人像是比賽般炫技，食品車車主不得不一次次提高音量來兜售啤酒、披薩和冰淇淋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "多利",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這裡比噴發的火山還要熱鬧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "總比之前的狂歡節更好，連肥仔都不喜歡那樣的派對。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我不會把所有混黑幫的戴著面具殺來殺去搞得整個城市都血淋淋的行為稱為“派對”，別侮辱這個詞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "一棵樹上結不出兩種果子，敘拉古人和那些狼真的太像了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "幾千上萬年前，我們嫌那些只知道廝殺的狼太蠢，每次開派對都不邀請他們，結果他們自己弄出了所謂的狼主遊戲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不過好在敘拉古人總算有了點長進，知道生活中有比殺人和搶地盤更值得慶祝的事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "至於那群一根筋的狼——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "肥仔，我們感受到的“不對勁”，他們肯定也感受到了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "有些事還是得找他們商量，誰叫我們是“同胞”呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大祭司",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我已經見過他們裡面沒那麼蠢的了，但在那無聊的遊戲結束前，他們是聽不進去任何話的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "按炎國話說，暫時先“入鄉隨俗”吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "別辜負派對！敘拉古人最好安排了一些更有趣的節目！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "<p=2>1100年11月9日    9:25 P.M.</>\n風吹在了德米特里的臉上。\n他記得自己昨天離開時病房的窗戶緊閉著，拉維妮婭也叮囑過護理師，深秋時節要注意室內的溫度——他抬眼看去，病床上已經空了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好久不見，德米特。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "私人醫生",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "抱歉，萊昂圖索先生，這個人非要闖進來。市政廳和法院的電話都暫時打不通，我聯絡不上拉維妮婭法官……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒關係，你先去忙吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你什麼時候醒的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "炫目的燈光攪動夜空，也把房間點亮，隔著窗戶都能隱隱聽到人潮那喧天的動靜。萊昂圖索就站在窗邊，看著狂歡中的城市。\n他已經換下了病服，完全看不出是個不久前還在昏迷的病人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "幾個小時前。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "德米特，想不到我們久別重逢，地點從餐廳變成了病房。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你還記得自己昏迷之前的行程，不錯。看來車禍沒有真的傷到你的腦子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嘖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "才剛醒，就把自己收拾得這麼俐落，別告訴我你打算趕去狂歡節的現場。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "護理師想必說過，此時此刻你更應該躺回去休息……你裡面的繃帶都還沒拆吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "頭有一點暈，剛剛吃了藥，還好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "今夜，數十萬民眾都將走上街頭，共享狂歡，慶祝新沃爾西尼建成一周年。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "按照原本的計劃，巡遊的隊伍將從拓展地塊開始，經過九個地塊的二十三條街道，沿途解鎖各種慶典活動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "最終，他們會在午夜時分到達城市的地標——法院廣場，而我會在那裡發表演說，和所有人共同迎接新一天的到來——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "市政廳會安排其他活動來填補這個空白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你大可以等到狀態更好的時候，再宣布正式就任市長。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "德米特，你是這麼想的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "萊昂圖索轉過了身。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "直到現在，拉維妮婭都沒有向民眾通知演說已經取消，我不覺得她是因為太忙所以忘了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這幾天發生的事情我已經知道了個大概。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "港口區的車禍，緊接著是新沃爾西尼港失火……如果市長缺席今晚原定的活動，民眾們會作何想？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "如果狂歡節平安無事，我的缺席只不過會損害一些我個人的信用，那自然是沒什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但如果此刻窗外絢爛的燈光下，真的藏了一些東西，我需要在現場。就這麼簡單。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好了，德米特，我們沒能完成的聚餐就改日吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德米特里",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "就今天。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊昂圖索",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
