    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柳德米拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "說起來也真可笑，我一次次遇見那個傢伙，倒楣的事情也一件接著一件，像是一個沒辦法打破的魔咒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柳德米拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我們今天要對付的是一群殘忍的狼，我見識過他們的手段。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柳德米拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以這一次，我必須要留在你們身邊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡車司機",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "唉，別在意，柳德米拉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡車司機",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那傢伙在你復仇的時候戲弄你，還殺了你的老師，如果是我，肯定會比你更控制不住自己。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡車司機",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這樣吧，等今天晚上這些亂糟糟的事情都結束，大家陪你去找她，狠狠地痛扁她一頓，再把她倒掛在車後面吃灰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡車司機",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "有我們在，以後沒人敢欺負我們的倒楣蛋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "柳德米拉",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呵。別耍嘴皮子了，走吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我來了……嘖，這地方可真難找。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "老闆，我們的人都已經就位了。不過這麼關鍵的時候，你不去現場盯著嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼奧",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "過來看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "法院廣場？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我過來時東繞西繞，以為快走到另一個城區了。結果這棟房子離法院廣場這麼近？我甚至看得到法院窗戶上的海報……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼奧",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "足夠隱蔽，但廣場及周圍幹道發生了什麼都一目了然。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼奧",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "塵埃落定之前，我會待在這裡，即時發布命令。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "倉促之間，你是怎麼找到這種地方並買下來的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼奧",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "它一直在我的名下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼奧",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我來到新沃爾西尼後不久就買下了這裡，偶爾會過來坐坐，讓自己休個假。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……看著法院和市政廳大樓休假？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼奧",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……老家主安頓得怎麼樣了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "放心。宅邸裡留了人，我也準備了足夠多的威士忌和雪茄，還有典藏版的唱片，老家主今夜都不需要離開他的房間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼奧",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "港口？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "甘比諾已經搞定了。今天晚上，只有我們的陸行艦能夠鎖定並靠近這座移動城市……算算時間，也應該差不多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可調用的載具都已經到達新沃爾西尼港附近，一旦陸行艦完成接駁，我們會馬上把船上的“貨”卸下來，送到每一位成員手裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "接下來，就看我們這邊了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼奧",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "遊行的隊伍到哪裡了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "新藝術區，那邊全是劇場和娛樂設施，沿街安排了非常多的演出，還有花車與遊客互動的活動，熱鬧非凡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼奧",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "還有一個多小時的時間。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼奧",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "附近的成員雖然數量不多，但都是家族的精銳，之前運進城的武器也已經讓他們裝備好了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼奧",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "此時新沃爾西尼大多數的警力都在沿途維持秩序，廣場的警備相對薄弱，趁著這個空檔，盡快控制法院和其他行政大樓。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼奧",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "這樣一來，港口和法院便都落入了我們手中，加上陸行艦的補給，威尼斯家族便能在實際上控制整個新沃爾西尼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼奧",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "徹夜狂歡的幾十萬新沃爾西尼人，都該清醒了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……我突然想到一件事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼奧",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "按照市政廳的安排，巡遊隊伍抵達廣場時，將看到萊昂圖索發表就職演說，新秩序啊、敘拉古的未來啊什麼的……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "既然到時候迎接他們的是全副武裝的威尼斯家族，老闆，你是不是也應該說些什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼奧",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "沒那個必要，卡彭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼奧",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "此時此刻，你應該在意的是，當了那麼久的載具公司職員，拿起武器時手會不會生疏了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "放心——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼奧",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "卡彭，我瞭解過你們的歷史。敘拉古歷史上的第一場城邦戰爭便是由西西里人所發起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼奧",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你們在城市裡橫行，將武器對準每一個出聲反抗的人，用鐮刀收割戰敗者的尾巴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼奧",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "某種意義上，那才是敘拉古的第一場“狂歡節”，儘管後來才有了這個貼切的名字。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安東尼奧",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "證明給我看，西西里人，證明是你們開啟了敘拉古的歷史。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呃，這種動員你應該對著甘比諾做，只有那傢伙還會把“西西里人”這種詞掛在嘴邊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡彭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "龍門、沃爾西尼、新沃爾西尼……這幾年我們已經輾轉了足夠多的地方。西西里夫人拋棄家族後，如今的西西里人連立足都有困難。"
